Data notice: the raw gamma grids (K/eU/eTh/TMI, GXF) and the radiometric CSV
originate from the USGS Ivanpah-Clark Mountain airborne survey; the surficial
geology is USGS SIM 3206 (DOI 10.3133/sim3206); the ASU endmember spectra are
from the ASU Thermal Emission Spectral Library; the NGU FDEM apparent-
resistivity statistics are from NGU surveys (Sulitjelma 2025, Roros 2020).
USGS and NGU data are public domain / open data; cite the original sources.
The synthetic TIR/EM cubes and all derived products are released under the
same MIT license.
